Package: mos-s905x5m-bluetooth
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mos build <mos@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: mos-board-s905x5m (= @VERSION@), mos-s905x5m-radio (= @VERSION@), mos-bluetooth (= @VERSION@), ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Seekwave Bluetooth vHCI transport for S905X5M
 The board-specific bridge, vendor library, controller configuration and unit.
 BlueZ and its persistent pairing mount remain owned by mos-bluetooth.
